{
  // Every test file, in one program. The root tsconfig EXCLUDES `convex/`,
  // `tests/` and `*.test.*`, and `convex/tsconfig.json` excludes its own
  // tests: without this configuration, no script types them. Run by
  // `pnpm typecheck:tests`, in the pre-push hook and in CI.
  //
  // - Playwright specs (`tests/e2e/`, `audit/`). `test.use({ reducedMotion })`,
  //   an option the pinned Playwright API does not have, went unnoticed
  //   because nothing typed them (issue #18): the test ran, but not in the
  //   conditions it announced. `audit/` is typed HERE and not by the root
  //   tsconfig: its specs import helpers from `tests/`, which `.vercelignore`
  //   leaves out of the upload; typed with the application, it broke the
  //   Vercel build ("Cannot find module '../../tests/e2e/_panneau'", 28/09).
  // - Vitest files, same globs as `test.include` in `vitest.config.ts`. Until
  //   02/10/2026 only the `.ts` files of `tests/unit/` were typed: 123 others
  //   (78 in `convex/`, 15 in `src/`, the 30 `.tsx` of `tests/unit/`) were
  //   only transpiled, so a call through the wrong reference (`api` for an
  //   internal mutation) or a fixture typed looser than the schema went
  //   through unnoticed.
  //
  // `vite/client` declares `import.meta.glob`, which the Convex tests call to
  // hand `convexTest` its modules. `vite` is a devDependency for that reason:
  // vitest only declares it as a peer.
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "noEmit": true,
    "incremental": false,
    "types": ["node", "vite/client"]
  },
  "include": [
    "tests/**/*.ts",
    "tests/**/*.tsx",
    "audit/**/*.ts",
    "playwright.config.ts",
    "convex/**/*.test.ts",
    "src/**/*.test.ts",
    "src/**/*.test.tsx"
  ],
  "exclude": ["node_modules"]
}
